    "Formula 与 Cask 使用不同的明确命令，一次计划只提交一种类型。操作不是事务，失败时可能已有部分项目完成升级。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Formula and Cask use separate, explicit commands. Each plan submits only one type. The operation is not transactional; some items may have been upgraded before a failure."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Formula 与 Cask 使用不同的明确命令，一次计划只提交一种类型。操作不是事务，失败时可能已有部分项目完成升级。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
