    "仅列出 Homebrew artifact 中明确声明、可解析且当前存在的精确路径；不展开 glob，也不进行名称或 bundle ID 模糊扫描。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only exact paths explicitly declared in Homebrew artifacts, resolvable, and currently present are listed. Glob patterns are not expanded, and names or bundle IDs are not searched for fuzzy matches."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅列出 Homebrew artifact 中明确声明、可解析且当前存在的精确路径；不展开 glob，也不进行名称或 bundle ID 模糊扫描。"
