    "会话切换只改变 Cellar 后续读取使用的受控 PATH，不会改变已经打开的终端。设为默认会修改 ~/.nvm/alias/default。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching the session only changes the controlled PATH used by subsequent Cellar reads; it does not change terminals already open. Setting the default updates ~/.nvm/alias/default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话切换只改变 Cellar 后续读取使用的受控 PATH，不会改变已经打开的终端。设为默认会修改 ~/.nvm/alias/default。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切換工作階段只改變 Cellar 後續讀取使用的受控 PATH，不會改變已開啟的終端機。設為預設會修改 ~/.nvm/alias/default。"
