    "移除前会扫描关联的已安装 Formula/Cask；存在关联项目时计划不可执行。Tap 变更不是事务。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before removal, related installed Formulae and Casks are scanned. The plan cannot execute while related items remain. Tap changes are not transactional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除前会扫描关联的已安装 Formula/Cask；存在关联项目时计划不可执行。Tap 变更不是事务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除前會掃描相關的已安裝 Formula/Cask；存在相關項目時計畫無法執行。Tap 變更不是交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方 Tap 可能访问网络并修改 Homebrew 管理的仓库状态。下一步只生成计划。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-party taps may access the network and modify repositories managed by Homebrew. The next step only prepares a plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第三方 Tap 可能访问网络并修改 Homebrew 管理的仓库状态。下一步只生成计划。"
