    "这些是 postflight 复查时仍存在的 Homebrew 声明路径。Cellar 仅报告，不会使用 sudo 或自行补删。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are Homebrew-declared paths still present during postflight verification. Cellar only reports them; it does not use sudo or delete them itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是 postflight 复查时仍存在的 Homebrew 声明路径。Cellar 仅报告，不会使用 sudo 或自行补删。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些是 postflight 複查時仍存在的 Homebrew 宣告路徑。Cellar 僅回報，不會使用 sudo 或自行補刪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是独立写操作，会先生成计划并等待确认；不会自动升级已安装项目。" : {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a separate write operation. A plan is prepared first and waits for confirmation; installed items are not automatically upgraded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是独立写操作，会先生成计划并等待确认；不会自动升级已安装项目。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是獨立寫入操作，會先產生計畫並等待確認；不會自動升級已安裝項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
